 * 941105 Llati		changed to use script reader, classes and added 
 *			exempt field. Changes to the data file will now 
 *			automatically be loaded
 * 950227 Paladin	Added array "untrusted" to bar untrusted wizards
 *			from entering player dec at all times.
 * 951127 Hunter	documented a lot of the code.
 * 960328 Gandalf	Appear to be bugs in the script reader; commented out
 *			the `exempt' processing for now.  Modified bar to
 *			check everyone periodically.  Will add warnings &
 *			an interface to armageddon soon; we need to be a little
